 kcms/style/ui/GtkStylePage.qml                | 10 -------
 kcms/wallpaper/ui/main.qml                    |  7 -----
 .../contents/ui/ThumbnailsComponent.qml       |  8 ------
 10 files changed, 108 deletions(-)

